  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 523 days after the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D7"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The FDA shortage posting for cefotetan dates to 2014-08-14 and has remained on the list for 146 months as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A registered plant on the Fresenius Kabi label, ACS Dobfar S.p.A. (FEI 3006028606), received an OAI classification after an inspection that ended 2016-01-19, which was 523 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D7", "E11", "E17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That same plant had prior VAI inspections ending 2012-03-27, 2014-03-18, and 2014-05-23, with the last two occurring 149 and 83 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D4", "D5", "D6", "E8", "E9", "E18"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to the plant on 2017-01-13, and subsequent inspections through 2024-12-13 have been classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E16", "E12", "E13", "E14", "E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The P&T-approved interchange from PAI Holdings (NDC 00121097610) to Fresenius Kabi (NDC 63323038510) was authorized by Sam Rivera, MD on 2026-04-28.",
      "cites": ["E24", "D9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory across three sites provides 11 to 25 days on hand at present usage rates.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    }
  ]
}
